# Forever game-type TOC. The client loads this instead of AHTooltipHider.toc
# when it still recognizes the Camelot suffix. Same addon either way.
# The wiki said this suffix may be renamed at launch; the unsuffixed file
# is the fallback and declares the same interface number.
## Interface: 16001
## Title: AH Tooltip Hider
## Notes: Hide auction-house item and equipped-gear tooltips while you preview gear. The checkbox resets when the auction house closes.
## Author: AH Tooltip Hider
## Version: 1.0.0
## Category: Auction & Economy
## IconTexture: Interface\Icons\INV_Misc_Coin_01

